 "note": "Freshness of every act in this repository: when it was last checked against its official source, how, and whether a known change is missing. One row per act in data/freshness/<shard>.csv (listed in data/freshness/index.json); `python tools/freshness.py <act id or folder>` reads them. A status is as of `as_of`; an act verified longer ago than its threshold has since become stale.",
